\A
DestinationRule/reviews -n e2e-istio-routing, created 1m ago, gen:1
  Current: Resource is current
  Host: Service/reviews
  mTLS: ISTIO_MUTUAL
  Outlier detection: eject on 5 consecutive 5xx, checked every 10s, for 30s, up to 100% of the pool
  Subsets:
    v1 version=v1
      Pod/reviews-v1-0, created 1m ago Running, 1/1 ready[^\n]*
    v2 version=v2, no pods
\z